From 659e5d2c0a1a547ae27308595d63a8bd04104d91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:15:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(google): add Gmail users.getProfile and history
 retention limit

users.getProfile returns emailAddress, messagesTotal, threadsTotal and the
current historyId, which Gmail clients use as the starting point for
incremental sync.

The new google.gmail_history_limit seed option keeps only the newest N
history records per user. history.list rejects a startHistoryId older than
the retained records with 404 NOT_FOUND, as Gmail does once history has
expired, so clients can test their full-sync fallback.
